Subject: [PATCH 1/2] script: Preallocate timer array (#48558)

This preallocates the timer array on timer fireing and pushes the
borrow_mut outside of the loop.
As any website should not have too many timers this (amazon seems to
have at most 85), this should not allocate too much space.

Testing: This just changes performance characteristics so should not
change functionality.

Signed-off-by: Narfinger <Narfinger@users.noreply.github.com>
